Description: Track and report code coverage for your package and
    (optionally) upload the results to a coverage service like 'Codecov'
    <https://about.codecov.io> or 'Coveralls' <https://coveralls.io>. Code
    coverage is a measure of the amount of code being exercised by a set
    of tests. It is an indirect measure of test quality and completeness.
    This package is compatible with any testing methodology or framework
    and tracks coverage of both R code and compiled C, C++, Fortran and
    Rust code.
